        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Rise of Solo Living&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3rMdv4zAo1jGpxg5FYlWXGFggb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Rise of Solo Living&nbsp;cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng nhiều người chọn sống một m&igrave;nh.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0QrdAMv7oilThxPJ5wlCi6mgHp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL7id1P5PoeP9GxtckAlXjQLgKc\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Rise of Solo Living&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAB3dnRwhoeC1Wx60mOlZ5Zkgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFFwdCaMRo6xOJxKGselA3gxgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the increasing trend of STH<em> (xu hướng ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng phổ biến của)</em></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">solo living <em>(sống một m&igrave;nh)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-e2efc490-7fff-6491-de72-ed11a0966a07\"></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>'xu hướng n&agrave;y sẽ mang lại nhiều t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực hơn l&agrave; t&iacute;ch cực'. </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\"><strong>BODY 1: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; của xu hướng n&agrave;y.</li>\n<li><strong>BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực <strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-0fbb75f3-7fff-6a30-5e24-4cbfae79bdc5\">đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại</strong>.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C6DFdb7UeoXdCaxuQSBlQa9Ogqe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong></span> Phải thừa nhận rằng,&nbsp;việc sống một m&igrave;nh mang lại một số lợi &iacute;ch nhất định cho sự ph&aacute;t triển c&aacute; nh&acirc;n.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RZcKdzjBwoBusIxbaEIlhfDYgqd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Trước hết, sống một m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể trao cho mọi người <em>quyền tự chủ c&aacute; nh&acirc;n v&agrave; sự tự do chưa từng c&oacute; để đưa ra c&aacute;c lựa chọn về lối sống (unprecedented personal autonomy and freedom to make lifestyle choices)</em>.</li>\n<li><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-fa17f3ae-7fff-64a9-7c9a-c4955dee3bf5\">Example:</strong> Chẳng hạn, mỗi người c&oacute; thể tự <em>sắp xếp kh&ocirc;ng gian sống, thiết lập th&oacute;i quen h&agrave;ng ng&agrave;y v&agrave; theo đuổi sở th&iacute;ch c&aacute; nh&acirc;n (organize their living spaces, establish daily routines, and pursue personal interests)</em> m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng cần phải<em> chiều theo sở th&iacute;ch hay lịch tr&igrave;nh của người kh&aacute;c (accommodate others' preferences or schedules)</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VmJ7d25upop9tUxS1JAllTohgNg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Ngo&agrave;i ra, sống độc th&acirc;n c&ograve;n c&oacute; thể <em>tạo điều kiện tối ưu cho sự thăng tiến trong sự nghiệp (create optimal conditions for career advancement)</em> v&agrave; <em>ph&aacute;t triển bản th&acirc;n một c&aacute;ch tập trung (focused personal growth)</em>.</li>\n<li><strong>Reason + Impact: </strong>Khi <em>sống độc lập (maintain independent households)</em>, mọi người c&oacute; thể <em>d&agrave;nh tối đa thời gian v&agrave; năng lượng cho c&aacute;c mục ti&ecirc;u nghề nghiệp hoặc theo đuổi học vấn (dedicate maximum time and energy to professional goals or educational pursuits)</em> m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng bị ph&acirc;n t&acirc;m bởi <em>việc nh&agrave; hay c&aacute;c nghĩa vụ với th&agrave;nh vi&ecirc;n gia đ&igrave;nh (domestic distractions or obligations to family members)</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-e16abdb7-7fff-afe9-6ef1-763af2814b25\"></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\">Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y g&acirc;y ra.</span><br></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TxrhdY5gSooM4IxJahHlrGSjgkb\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span> </strong>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng&nbsp;sống độc th&acirc;n c&oacute; thể tạo ra nhiều vấn đề hơn đ&aacute;ng kể so với lợi &iacute;ch, cho cả c&aacute; nh&acirc;n v&agrave; x&atilde; hội n&oacute;i chung.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IXfqdgollov4jlxHOMxlUAIWgqd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Quan trọng nhất, <em>việc gia tăng sự t&aacute;ch biệt (increased isolation)</em> c&oacute; thể <em>l&agrave;m suy yếu một c&aacute;ch cơ bản c&aacute;c mối li&ecirc;n kết x&atilde; hội (fundamentally undermine the social connections)</em> vốn thiết yếu cho sức khỏe tinh thần.</li>\n<li><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-453922a7-7fff-f4d5-4c3e-3c9c3ee131c7\">Example: </strong>V&iacute; dụ, những người sống một m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể trải qua<em> tỷ lệ c&ocirc; đơn, trầm cảm v&agrave; lo lắng cao hơn (higher rates of loneliness, depression, and anxiety) </em>so với những người sống c&ugrave;ng người kh&aacute;c, v&igrave; họ <em>thiếu tương t&aacute;c trực tiếp v&agrave; sự hỗ trợ cảm x&uacute;c (lack face-to-face interactions and emotional support)</em> vốn c&oacute; trong m&ocirc;i trường gia đ&igrave;nh hoặc cộng đồng.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BaPNd6J5Gol93zx83BDlouuwgQd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Core idea 2: </strong>Hơn nữa,<em> những chi ph&iacute; kinh tế v&agrave; m&ocirc;i trường (the economic and environmental costs)</em> của lối sống độc th&acirc;n c&oacute; thể <em>tạo ra g&aacute;nh nặng đ&aacute;ng kể cho x&atilde; hội (create significant societal burdens)</em>.</li>\n<li><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> Khi c&aacute; nh&acirc;n sống, họ c&oacute; xu hướng<em> ti&ecirc;u thụ t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n nhiều hơn hẳn (consume disproportionately more resources)</em> như nh&agrave; ở hay c&aacute;c tiện &iacute;ch. Điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể g&oacute;p phần g&acirc;y ra <em>t&igrave;nh trạng thiếu nh&agrave; ở v&agrave; chi ph&iacute; sinh hoạt cao hơn (housing shortages and higher living costs)</em>, g&acirc;y ảnh hưởng đến to&agrave;n bộ cộng đồng.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2ludgo4OokMAXxI7XBlboYqgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LuP6d7JcNomKxzxUlHJlThqKgLe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">personal freedom<em> (sự tự do c&aacute; nh&acirc;n)</em></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">career focus <em>(khả năng tập trung cho c&ocirc;ng việc)</em></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">negative impacts on mental health, social cohesion, and economic efficiency<em> (những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đến sức khỏe tinh thần, sự gắn kết x&atilde; hội v&agrave; hiệu quả kinh tế)</em></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">weaken individual wellbeing and community bonds<em> (l&agrave;m suy yếu sức khoẻ c&aacute; nh&acirc;n v&agrave; c&aacute;c mối li&ecirc;n kết x&atilde; hội)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1147,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Opinions are divided on whether the increasing trend of people choosing to live alone represents a positive or negative social development. While solo living may offer certain advantages, I believe this trend is largely negative as the detrimental impacts significantly outweigh any potential benefits.</p>",
            "question_id": 17024,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1148,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Admittedly, the rise in solo living arrangements could provide certain benefits for individual development.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Firstly, living alone might grant people unprecedented personal autonomy and freedom to make lifestyle choices. For instance, individuals could organize their living spaces, establish daily routines, and pursue personal interests without needing to accommodate others' preferences or schedules. <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Additionally, solo living might create optimal conditions for career advancement and focused personal growth. When people maintain independent households, they could dedicate maximum time and energy to professional goals or educational pursuits without domestic distractions or obligations to family members.</span></span></p>",
            "question_id": 17024,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1149,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>However, I am convinced that solo living could create substantially more problems than benefits for both individuals and society overall. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Most importantly, increased isolation might fundamentally undermine the social connections that are essential&nbsp; for emotional wellbeing. For example, people living alone might experience higher rates of loneliness, depression, and anxiety compared to those in shared living arrangements, as they lack face-to-face interactions and emotional support that naturally occur in family or communal settings. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Furthermore, the economic and environmental costs of solo living could create significant societal burdens. When individuals live alone, they tend to consume disproportionately more resources such as housing or utilities. This could contribute to housing shortages and higher living costs that might affect entire communities.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 17024,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1150,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">In conclusion, while solo living might provide some advantages in terms of personal freedom and career focus, the potentially serious negative impacts on mental health, social cohesion, and economic efficiency suggest that this trend represents a concerning development that may weaken both individual wellbeing and community bonds.</p>",
